---
manual: slot.top
lines: [2507, 2509]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: A4
expect: fail
reason: Lacci's top reads the :top style (0 when unset); nothing feeds laid-out positions back from the display (ledger A4 covers sizes; positions need a row)
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  stack width: 400, height: 30
  @box = stack width: 50, height: 20
end
----------- test code
box = stack("@box")
assert_in_delta 30, layout_of(box).y, 0.5
assert_in_delta 30, box.top, 0.5, "top is where the slot sits, in pixels"
